==English==
{{wikipedia|in absentia (disambiguation)|in absentia}}

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|la|in}} + {{m|la|absentia||absence}}.

===Prepositional phrase===
{{en-PP|head=in absentia}}

# {{lb|en|legal}} While not present; while [[absent]]
#: {{ux|en|The defendant was convicted '''''in absentia''''' after fleeing during the trial.}}

